        observe: "Track error responses by status code and exception type, and link each 5xx to a correlation id in logs and traces; rising 409s often reveal concurrency problems in the UI.",
        security: "Map authorisation failures carefully: returning 404 instead of 403 for resources a user may not see avoids confirming that they exist.",
        checklist: ['Exceptions translated at layer boundaries', 'Causes always preserved', 'Central handler mapping to status codes', 'Problem Details format', 'Log once with correlation id', 'Transient versus permanent types', 'No internals in responses'],
